---
title: "refund (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: whenNotPaused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_canceled: whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_refund_period: whenRefundPeriodNotOver
    q_check_refund_period --> q_get_position: positionId = getInvestorPositionId(sender)
    q_get_position --> q_verify_exists: verifyPositionExists(positionId)
    q_verify_exists --> q_verify_not_refunded: verifyHasNotRefunded(positionId)
    q_verify_not_refunded --> q_cache_amount: amountToRefund = position.investedCapital
    q_cache_amount --> q_zero_capital: position.investedCapital = 0
    q_zero_capital --> q_flag_refund: position.hasRefunded = true
    q_flag_refund --> q_decrement: totalCapitalInvested -= amountToRefund
    q_decrement --> q_emit: emit CapitalRefunded(amountToRefund, sender, positionId)
    q_emit --> [*]: safeTransfer(bidToken, sender, amountToRefund)

    note right of q_check_refund_period
        INV-001: refund only allowed while block.timestamp < refundEndTime
        INV-002: investor can only refund once (hasRefunded flag)
    end note

    note right of q_zero_capital
        INV-003: investedCapital set to 0 before transfer (reentrancy protection)
        INV-004: totalCapitalInvested decremented by exact refund amount
    end note
